      "message": "For the json schema, we have another option in libchrome: https://source.corp.google.com/h/chromium/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/libchrome/components/policy/core/common/chrome_schema.h",
      "parentUuid": "5d54b62e_70a10e6b",
