      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would prefer to have \n* ectool bcfg_get\n* ectool bcfg_set\n\n1. It\u0027s easier to know what the command does by its name.\n2 The function would be smaller if they are seperate.\n\n* ectool bcfg \u003cindex\u003e: I am not sure what this does, can you explain more on this function? If this is a new function, we can implment this in another CL.",
